//==
// # A model with its mesh (complexity sweep, chunk V2)
//
// The cross agreement laws of measures-given.laws.plato compare the library's
// geometry cross checks with the *Hoisted forms on a model and the mesh made
// from it. Each is a Witness_* value, so a sweep meshes the model once, not
// once per law case. Chunk L1's MeshedWitness (model and outcome) serves the
// same purpose once it merges; this type is deleted at merge.

// A model and a mesh to cross-check against it: the model's own witness mesh,
// or another model's mesh, so the checks fail somewhere.
// Removes: meshing a witness inside every case of an agreement law.
type CrossCheckPair
{
    Name: String;
    Model: BrepModel;
    Mesh: ModelMesh;
}
